,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,''),(53,'About Us','cms-full-width','','','about-us','About Otica Mart','<style>#html-body [data-pb-style=PUNIPN7]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:50px}#html-body [data-pb-style=OYJKK74],#html-body [data-pb-style=PUNIPN7],#html-body [data-pb-style=QU8V2T3]{background-position:left top;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-attachment:scroll}#html-body [data-pb-style=OYJKK74]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:35px}#html-body [data-pb-style=QU8V2T3]{align-self:stretch}#html-body [data-pb-style=GHPHBFI]{display:flex;width:100%}#html-body [data-pb-style=GYD00JN],#html-body [data-pb-style=JWJO8E0]{justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-position:left top;background-size:cover;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-attachment:scroll;width:50%;align-self:center}#html-body [data-pb-style=JWJO8E0]{align-self:stretch}#html-body [data-pb-style=E4U39BG]{border-style:none}#html-body [data-pb-style=DLBQ2SM],#html-body [data-pb-style=XJR67OV]{max-width:100%;height:auto}@media only screen and (max-width: 768px) { #html-body [data-pb-style=E4U39BG]{border-style:none} }</style><div data-content-type=\"row\" data-appearance=\"contained\" data-element=\"main\"><div class=\"container-small\" data-enable-parallax=\"0\" data-parallax-speed=\"0.5\" data-background-images=\"{}\" data-background-type=\"image\" data-video-loop=\"true\" data-video-play-only-visible=\"true\" data-video-lazy-load=\"true\" data-video-fallback-src=\"\" data-element=\"inner\" data-pb-style=\"PUNIPN7\"><div data-content-type=\"text\" data-appearance=\"default\" data-element=\"main\"><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Otica Meditronix is the leading company in Indian Market for providing best health care &amp; surgical Products, our extensive experience gathered over previous years has seen us specialize in medical and surgical devices, we have a wide range of CE and FDA certified products. As well as we are dealing with all kind of hospital – Equipment and furniture. With a team of highly experienced and dedicated and professionals and a focus on client satisfaction, we aim</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\">to strive and satisfy our clients in the most befitting manner by sharing their valuable feedback and offering customized solutions. Timely deliveries of ordered goods and fair-trade practice have placed us above the market players. Otica Meditronix co have started manufacturing unique Medical Equipments to help medical practitioners to improve quality treatments with less efforts and to prevent Human errors during treatments.</p></div></div></div><div data-content-type=\"row\" data-appearance=\"contained\" data-element=\"main\"><div class=\"container-small\" data-enable-parallax=\"0\" data-parallax-speed=\"0.5\" data-background-images=\"{}\" data-background-type=\"image\" data-video-loop=\"true\" data-video-play-only-visible=\"true\" data-video-lazy-load=\"true\" data-video-fallback-src=\"\" data-element=\"inner\" data-pb-style=\"OYJKK74\"><div class=\"pagebuilder-column-group\" data-background-images=\"{}\" data-content-type=\"column-group\" data-appearance=\"default\" data-grid-size=\"12\" data-element=\"main\" data-pb-style=\"QU8V2T3\"><div class=\"pagebuilder-column-line\" data-content-type=\"column-line\" data-element=\"main\" data-pb-style=\"GHPHBFI\"><div class=\"pagebuilder-column\" data-content-type=\"column\" data-appearance=\"align-center\" data-background-images=\"{}\" data-element=\"main\" data-pb-style=\"GYD00JN\"><div data-content-type=\"text\" data-appearance=\"default\" data-element=\"main\"><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><strong>We strive hard for providing maximum satisfaction to our clients by offering best quality range of products as per their precise needs. Below mentioned are key aspects for which we are highly appreciated in the market:</strong></p></div><div data-content-type=\"text\" data-appearance=\"default\" data-element=\"main\"><ul>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Rich vendor base</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Transparent dealing</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Optimum quality products</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Ethical business policy</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Wide distribution network</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Affordable pricing structure</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 2;\">Prompt delivery</li>\r\n</ul></div></div><div class=\"pagebuilder-column\" data-content-type=\"column\" data-appearance=\"full-height\" data-background-images=\"{}\" data-element=\"main\" data-pb-style=\"JWJO8E0\"><figure data-content-type=\"image\" data-appearance=\"full-width\" data-element=\"main\" data-pb-style=\"E4U39BG\"><img class=\"pagebuilder-mobile-hidden\" src=\"{{media url=wysiwyg/about-img.jpg}}\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" data-element=\"desktop_image\" data-pb-style=\"DLBQ2SM\"><img class=\"pagebuilder-mobile-only\" src=\"{{media url=wysiwyg/about-img.jpg}}\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" data-element=\"mobile_image\" data-pb-style=\"XJR67OV\"></figure></div></div></div></div></div>','2025-07-07 12:27:39','2025-07-16 07:16:51',1,0,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,''),(54,'Privacy policy','cms-full-width','','','privacy-policy','Privacy Policy','','2025-07-16 08:12:54','2025-07-16 08:13:10',1,0,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,''),(55,'Terms & Conditions','cms-full-width','','','terms-conditions','Terms & Conditions','','2025-07-16 08:15:15','2025-07-16 08:15:15',1,0,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,''),(56,'Warranty Registration','cms-full-width','','','warranty-registration-form','Warranty Registration Form','','2025-07-17 05:36:55','2025-07-17 05:38:37',1,0,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'');
